<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000004B1F000X_04_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000I8Y00000">
<testtitle>Recheck DTC (C1249/49)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the output status of DTC C1249/49. (For the procedure, refer to <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000060000PX"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="left">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>C1249/49 is not output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>C1249/49 is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000004B1F000X_04_0002" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM000004B1F000X_04_0010" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000004B1F000X_04_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___0000I8Z00000">
<testtitle>Inspect BRAKE LP Relay</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Remove the BRAKE LP relay from the engine room relay block.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check that the relay case and terminals are not deformed or corroded.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>No deformation or corrosion</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between each terminal of the relay.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C116660" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.24in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.86in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.03in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>1(RLY-) - 2(RLY+)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Approximately 111 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>5(ST+) - 3(STPL)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle">
<ptxt>When battery voltage is not applied between terminals 1 (RLY-) - 2 (RLY+)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>10k Ω or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>4(STP) - 3(STPL)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>5(ST+) - 3(STPL)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>When battery voltage is applied between terminals 1 (RLY-) and 2 (RLY+)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000004B1F000X_04_0003" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000004B1F000X_04_0011" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
