<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Clear the DTCs. (For the procedure, refer to <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000060000PX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>With the brake pedal not operated, turn the stop light drive relay ON using the Active Test, wait for 2 seconds or more, and check the DTC output. (For the procedure, refer to <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000000602011X"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Stop light drive relay malfunction DTC is not output</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
